# NestJS gRPC Filter Generation Pattern

Use this when creating or updating `filters/*.filter.ts` under `src/libs/<lib_name>/src/classes/<module>/filters/`. Do not infer field names from entities, services, or `model.proto`.

## Source of truth

- Read **only** from `src/libs/<lib_name>/src/proto/<module>/filter.proto`.
- Import generated interfaces from `@generated/<module>/filter`.
- Proto package folder uses snake_case (`knowledge_group`); class folder uses kebab-case (`knowledge-group`).
- Do **not** add `{Entity}UniqueParams` here — that belongs in `dto/params.dto.ts`.

## Required file and classes

| Proto message     | Class                | Extends       |
| ----------------- | -------------------- | ------------- |
| `{Entity}Sorts`   | `{Entity}SortsDto`   | `BaseSorts`   |
| `{Entity}Filters` | `{Entity}FiltersDto` | `BaseFilters` |
| `{Entity}Filter`  | `{Entity}FilterDto`  | `BaseFilter`  |

- File name: `<kebab-module>.filter.ts` (e.g. `knowledge-group.filter.ts`).
- Export all three classes from one file.
- Map proto field names to TypeScript **as-is** (snake_case).
- Do **not** redeclare `offset` on `{Entity}FilterDto` — it comes from `BaseFilter` / proto `common.FilterOffset`.

## Field rules

### `{Entity}SortsDto`

- One optional property per field in proto `{Entity}Sorts`.
- Decorator: `@IsSortOrder()` only (no `@ApiProperty` on sort fields).

### `{Entity}FiltersDto`

- One optional property per field in proto `{Entity}Filters`.
- Every field: `@IsOptional()` + `@ApiProperty({ required: false })`.
- Use validators from the mapping table below.

### `{Entity}FilterDto`

- Nested `sorts` and `filter` only (match proto `{Entity}Filter` fields 2–3; skip `offset`).
- Each nested field: `@ValidateNested()`, `@Type(() => …Dto)`, `@IsOptional()`, `@ApiProperty({ required: false })`.

## Imports

```typescript
import { {Entity}Filter, {Entity}Filters, {Entity}Sorts } from '@generated/<module>/filter'
import { ApiProperty } from '@nestjs/swagger'
import { BaseFilter, BaseFilters, BaseSorts, IsSortOrder, SortOrders, ValidationErrors } from 'nestjs-typeorm-shared'
import { IsInt, IsOptional, IsString, ValidateNested } from 'class-validator'
import { i18nValidationMessage } from 'nestjs-i18n'
import { Type } from 'class-transformer'
```

## Golden example (`knowledge_group` → `knowledge-group`)

Proto (`filter.proto`):

```protobuf
message KnowledgeGroupSorts {
  optional common.SortOrders knowledge_group_id = 1;
  optional common.SortOrders knowledge_group_name = 2;
  optional common.SortOrders permission = 3;
  optional common.SortOrders parent_group_id = 4;
}

message KnowledgeGroupFilters {
  optional int32 knowledge_group_id = 1;
  optional string knowledge_group_name = 2;
  optional string permission = 3;
  optional int32 parent_group_id = 4;
}

message KnowledgeGroupFilter {
  optional common.FilterOffset offset = 1;
  optional KnowledgeGroupSorts sorts = 2;
  optional KnowledgeGroupFilters filter = 3;
}
```

### `filters/knowledge-group.filter.ts`

```typescript
import { KnowledgeGroupFilter, KnowledgeGroupFilters, KnowledgeGroupSorts } from '@generated/knowledge_group/filter'
import { ApiProperty } from '@nestjs/swagger'
import { BaseFilter, BaseFilters, BaseSorts, IsSortOrder, SortOrders, ValidationErrors } from 'nestjs-typeorm-shared'
import { IsInt, IsOptional, IsString, ValidateNested } from 'class-validator'
import { i18nValidationMessage } from 'nestjs-i18n'
import { Type } from 'class-transformer'

export class KnowledgeGroupSortsDto extends BaseSorts implements KnowledgeGroupSorts {
  @IsSortOrder()
  knowledge_group_id?: SortOrders

  @IsSortOrder()
  knowledge_group_name?: SortOrders

  @IsSortOrder()
  permission?: SortOrders

  @IsSortOrder()
  parent_group_id?: SortOrders
}

export class KnowledgeGroupFiltersDto extends BaseFilters implements KnowledgeGroupFilters {
  @IsInt({ message: i18nValidationMessage(ValidationErrors.NUMBER_FORMAT) })
  @IsOptional()
  @ApiProperty({ required: false })
  knowledge_group_id?: number

  @IsString({ message: i18nValidationMessage(ValidationErrors.STRING_FORMAT) })
  @IsOptional()
  @ApiProperty({ required: false })
  knowledge_group_name?: string

  @IsString({ message: i18nValidationMessage(ValidationErrors.STRING_FORMAT) })
  @IsOptional()
  @ApiProperty({ required: false })
  permission?: string

  @IsInt({ message: i18nValidationMessage(ValidationErrors.NUMBER_FORMAT) })
  @IsOptional()
  @ApiProperty({ required: false })
  parent_group_id?: number
}

export class KnowledgeGroupFilterDto extends BaseFilter implements KnowledgeGroupFilter {
  @ValidateNested()
  @Type(() => KnowledgeGroupSortsDto)
  @IsOptional()
  @ApiProperty({ required: false })
  sorts?: KnowledgeGroupSortsDto

  @ValidateNested()
  @Type(() => KnowledgeGroupFiltersDto)
  @IsOptional()
  @ApiProperty({ required: false })
  filter?: KnowledgeGroupFiltersDto
}
```
